{"n":17,"title":"People-watching","blurb":"By the end you can describe people — She has long hair, He's tall — and use adjectives in order (a tall young man).","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Quick recall from Lesson 16. Choose, then check.","sub":"Здесь нет правильного ответа","options":[{"label":"can"},{"label":"can&#x27;t"},{"label":"could"},{"label":"can&#x27;t"},{"label":"can"},{"label":"could"},{"label":"Can"},{"label":"Do"},{"label":"Is"},{"label":"can"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"Hair, eyes","pos":"","ru":"волосы, глаза","kk":"шаш, көз","def":"it grows on your head; you see with them","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-hair-eyes.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/1e4b785be5a0.mp3"},{"en":"Tall, short","pos":"","ru":"высокий, низкий","kk":"бойшаң, аласа","def":"with big height; not tall","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-tall-short.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/6d36bc4fb1c5.mp3"},{"en":"Young, old","pos":"","ru":"молодой, старый","kk":"жас, қарт","def":"with few years; with many years","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-young-old.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/12a72204a655.mp3"},{"en":"Beautiful, good-looking","pos":"","ru":"красивый, привлекательный","kk":"әдемі, көрікті","def":"very nice to look at","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-beautiful-good-looking.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/3d017ec59ca3.mp3"},{"en":"Clever, friendly","pos":"","ru":"умный, дружелюбный","kk":"ақылды, ашық-жарқын","def":"quick to understand; nice to people","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-clever-friendly.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a3e711ee0b3c.mp3"},{"en":"Funny, kind, nice","pos":"","ru":"смешной, добрый, милый","kk":"күлкілі, мейірімді, жағымды","def":"making you laugh; good to others; pleasant","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-funny-kind-nice.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c70f8272c68a.mp3"},{"en":"Quiet","pos":"","ru":"тихий","kk":"тыныш","def":"not loud; not talking much","img":"/course/a0/img/